{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0b19aa9dc5a833d8cf4","chatId":"6a7ae375541549a99d8fa40261bf1ce0","sessionId":null,"userId":98456,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1187,"promptTokens":1570,"completionTokens":49,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:13"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908711159049626,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b19aa9dc5a833d8cf3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482353436,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0b19aa9dc5a833d8cf3","chatId":"6a7ae375541549a99d8fa40261bf1ce0","sessionId":null,"userId":98456,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n蕾切尔今天把她三岁的女儿交给她母亲，然后去参加一个工作会议。她特别提醒母亲不要太溺爱女儿。当她去接女儿的时候，她看到女儿正在开心地吃巧克力，脸上和手上都沾满了巧克力。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，蕾切尔最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤心 & 悔恨\nB) 伤心 & 爱护\nC) 尴尬 & 爱护\nD) 嫉妒 & 爱护\nE) 伤心 & 嫉妒\nF) 生气 & 爱护\n\n## 问题 2\n蕾切尔为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她的母亲按照她的特定指示行事 & 她忘了买一些巧克力\nB) 蕾切尔不喜欢巧克力 & 她忘了买一些巧克力\nC) 她对她妈妈给了她女儿很多巧克力很生气 & 她看到女儿高兴地微笑着\nD) 她看到女儿高兴地微笑着 & 蕾切尔不喜欢巧克力\nE) 她看到女儿高兴地微笑着 & 她想亲自给她的女儿巧克力\nF) 她的母亲按照她的特定指示行事 & 蕾切尔不喜欢巧克力","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908711159049626,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b19aa9dc5a833d8cf4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482353434,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9214156657d24509914e2d4c2273377e"}